{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/raw-district-imtiaz-developments-sheikh-zayed-road","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1479,"crm_id":"8340","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Raw District","slug":"raw-district-imtiaz-developments-sheikh-zayed-road","display_address":"Sheikh Zayed Road","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Imtiaz Developments","price":649000,"display_price":"649K","lattitude":24.977460003253,"longitude":55.091848007665,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Raw District by Imtiaz Developments is a bold new Dubai off-plan project introducing a live-work-create lifestyle concept in the heart of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-jebel-ali/\">Downtown Jebel Ali</a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-imtiaz-developments/\">Imtiaz Developments</a>, the community features four contemporary towers connected through vibrant public spaces, premium residences, creative hubs, retail outlets, and wellness-driven experiences. The project offers a collection of fully furnished <strong>studio, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments</strong> along with offices and retail outlets designed with modern layouts, smart-home integration, and sophisticated contemporary interiors.</p><p>Strategically located near the metro station on Sheikh Zayed Road, Raw District Dubai apartments offer seamless connectivity to Dubai Marina, Expo City, Palm Jumeirah, and key business districts.&nbsp;</p><p>The project includes fully furnished apartments with integrated smart features, modern finishes, and access to signature amenities including co-working lounges, cold plunges, cinema spaces, swimming pools, and curated social environments tailored for modern professionals and investors.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_d87e8bb0de.jpg","hash":"Feature_d87e8bb0de","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_108d3d702d.jpg","hash":"Banner_108d3d702d","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_5_a84fbbd46f.jpg","hash":"Gallery_5_a84fbbd46f","name":"Gallery-5.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_3_bea6dc211e.jpg","hash":"Gallery_3_bea6dc211e","name":"Gallery-3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_2_78b1e3f9af.jpg","hash":"Gallery_2_78b1e3f9af","name":"Gallery-2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_4_0fa2cd14d1.jpg","hash":"Gallery_4_0fa2cd14d1","name":"Gallery-4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1_6f9c2b7260.jpg","hash":"Gallery_1_6f9c2b7260","name":"Gallery-1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_6_4ae2ed20f7.jpg","hash":"Gallery_6_4ae2ed20f7","name":"Gallery-6.jpg"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":2196,"cta":{"id":3028,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Selling_Point_211599fed3.jpg","hash":"Selling_Point_211599fed3","name":"Selling-Point.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Raw District: Crafted Around Modern Urban Energy","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Creative Lifestyle Community: Designed for entrepreneurs, creators, professionals, and modern residents seeking integrated urban experiences.</li><li>Me