own for premium lifestyle-focused residential and mixed-use communities across the UAE.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Raw District Dubai?"},{"id":10322,"answer":"<p>Yes, Raw District Dubai is expected to offer freehold ownership opportunities, making it attractive for both local and international investors seeking Dubai off-plan property investments.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Raw District Dubai freehold?"},{"id":10323,"answer":"<p>Raw District by Imtiaz Amenities include RAW Pro Gym, podcast studios, swimming pools, co-working spaces, yoga decks, libraries, cafés, cinema spaces, wellness zones, observation decks, and landscaped social areas.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What are the amenities in Raw District Dubai?"},{"id":10324,"answer":"<p>Prices at Raw District Dubai start from AED 649,000 for studios, while larger apartments, offices, and retail spaces are available at varying price points depending on layout and size.</p>","question":"How much do apartments cost in Raw District Dubai?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_108d3d702d.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Banner_108d3d702d.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x/Banner_108d3d702d.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x","created_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645","updated_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/Banner_108d3d702d.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645","updated_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Banner_108d3d702d.webp","format":"webp","transform":"744x","created_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645","updated_at":"2026-06-22 11:32:54.645"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x